{"route":"/docs/4.6/about/team/","version":"4.6","renderedVersion":"4.6","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Team","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.6.2/site/content/docs/4.6/about/team.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"An overview of the founding team and core contributors to Bootstrap."},{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap is maintained by the founding team and a small group of invaluable core contributors, with the massive support and involvement of our community."},{"id":"content--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/mdo\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"@mdo\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Mark Otto</strong> @mdo</a>\n  \n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fat\"><img src=\"https://github.com/fat.png\" alt=\"@fat\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Jacob Thornton</strong> @fat</a>\n  \n    <a href=\"https://github.com/xhmikosr\"><img src=\"https://github.com/xhmikosr.png\" alt=\"@xhmikosr\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>XhmikosR</strong> @xhmikosr</a>\n  \n    <a href=\"https://github.com/geosot\"><img src=\"https://github.com/geosot.png\" alt=\"@geosot\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>GeoSot</strong> @geosot</a>\n  \n    <a href=\"https://github.com/rohit2sharma95\"><img src=\"https://github.com/rohit2sharma95.png\" alt=\"@rohit2sharma95\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Rohit Sharma</strong> @rohit2sharma95</a>\n  \n    <a href=\"https://github.com/alpadev\"><img src=\"https://github.com/alpadev.png\" alt=\"@alpadev\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>alpadev</strong> @alpadev</a>\n  \n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ffoodd\"><img src=\"https://github.com/ffoodd.png\" alt=\"@ffoodd\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Gaël Poupard</strong> @ffoodd</a>\n  \n    <a href=\"https://github.com/patrickhlauke\"><img src=\"https://github.com/patrickhlauke.png\" alt=\"@patrickhlauke\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Patrick H. Lauke</strong> @patrickhlauke</a>\n  \n    <a href=\"https://github.com/martijncuppens\"><img src=\"https://github.com/martijncuppens.png\" alt=\"@martijncuppens\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Martijn Cuppens</strong> @martijncuppens</a>\n  \n    <a href=\"https://github.com/johann-s\"><img src=\"https://github.com/johann-s.png\" alt=\"@johann-s\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Johann-S</strong> @johann-s</a>\n  \n    <a href=\"https://github.com/glebm\"><img src=\"https://github.com/glebm.png\" alt=\"@glebm\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <strong>Gleb Mazovetskiy</strong> @glebm</a>"},{"id":"content--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Get involved with Bootstrap development by <a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/issues/new\">opening an issue</a> or submitting a pull request. Read our <a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.6.2/.github/CONTRIBUTING.md\">contributing guidelines</a> for information on how we develop."}],"demos":[],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Content","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/alerts/"},{"en":"Utilities","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/borders/"},{"en":"Extend","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/extend/approach/"},{"en":"Migration","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/migration/"},{"en":"About","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/overview/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/overview/"},{"en":"Team","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/team/"},{"en":"Brand","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/brand/"},{"en":"License","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/license/"},{"en":"Tran